                    <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top">Nothing happens on Ctrl+V (Windows or WSL)</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top">Terminal intercepts it</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top">Press Alt+V</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top">A file path appears</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top">Clipboard holds a file reference</td><td class="px-4 py-3 align-top">Open the image and copy it, or drag the file in</td></tr>
